      "role": "user",
      "content": "look, the goblin stuff isn't helping me. i'm not looking for metaphors, i'm trying to fix a production bug. i need the actual technical reasons why a valid card would trigger a 402 intermittently. could it be related to request timing, concurrency, or maybe some kind of race condition in how the payload is being structured? please just give me the technical breakdown.",
